        <mxCell id="c78" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;CPAWS — current architecture (as of 2026-11-05)&lt;/b&gt;. Solid = deployed and running; faded icon + dashed arrow = in progress (PR #87, #89), not deployed yet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Flows:&lt;/b&gt; 1 schedule ingest · 2 fetch prices · 3 write raw/clean snapshot · 4 trigger predict · 5 read snapshot, write S1a shadow · 6 write forecast (no overwrite) · 7–9 daily accuracy job (schedule disabled) · 10 open web · 11 sign in · 12 call API with ID token · 13 read forecasts · 14 chat quota · 15 Bedrock Converse with tools get_forecast / get_news · 16 accuracy API · 17 alarms to email · 18 deploy from laptop.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Changed vs. proposal:&lt;/b&gt; no Step Functions / SageMaker training and Model Registry (ADR-0011, champion baseline-q252 with S1a in shadow); no Bedrock batch labeling or Knowledge Bases (ADR-0013, manual news labels); Secrets Manager → SSM Parameter Store; GitHub Actions is CI only (no CD); Bedrock Guardrail not attached yet." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="1365" x="200" y="1078" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
